=== Text #18 ===
> I found an interesting article here.
The article itself is pretty cut and dry, a bunch of butthurt dumb asses complaining to their superiors. What’s interesting is the response their superiors gave. Which I have the pleasure of showing you.
This is in response to the New Year’s Eve hack of the California[ State]wide[ Law Enforcement] Association website by Anonymous, a loose knit band of cyber experts who have gained access to other[ law] enforcement association sites including PORAC and many other international corporations.
Thats the first paragraph now let me narrow down the interesting part.
Remember when they used to call us a bunch of teenagers that have a bit of motivation but can’t do[ anything]?
To think how much they change their tones, they now know the truth.[][][][][]

